        <name>index_base</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Index base for MessagePack update operations. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If update is from Lua, then the base is 1. Otherwise 0. That field exists because Lua uses 1-based array indexing, and Lua-to-MessagePack encoder keeps this indexing when encodes operations array. Index base allows not to re-encode each Lua update with 0-based indexes. </para>        </detaileddescription>
